 "x0": 0.23308270842183645, "x1": 0.42105263368342666, "t": "S1 is true and S2 is false."}, {"y0": 0.3648255815780629, "y1": 0.37936046478821617, "x0": 0.18984962487272708, "x1": 0.21992481171875164, "t": "(C)"}, {"y0": 0.36482558136846577, "y1": 0.3764534883989761, "x0": 0.23496240901550547, "x1": 0.421052633230735, "t": "S1 is false and S2 is true."}, {"y0": 0.41279069780868305, "y1": 0.42732558101883633, "x0": 0.18984962452811555, "x1": 0.2199248113741401, "t": "(D)"}, {"y0": 0.41272727297394685, "y1": 0.42606060630728004, "x0": 0.23308271399528663, "x1": 0.4229323283449389, "t": "Both S1 and S2 are false."}, {"y0": 0.5377906979461261, "y1": 0.5566860460037285, "x0": 0.16353383426104423, "x1": 0.1954887221534295, "t": "9.7"}, {"y0": 0.5406060607666188, "y1": 0.5539393940999522, "x0": 0.23684211381390644, "x1": 0.8345864725582736, "t": "Consider the three-way handshake mechanism followed during TCP connection es-"}, {"y0": 0.5566860469584775, "y1": 0.5697674415008248, "x0": 0.23496239928070395, "x1": 0.8364661601177926, "t": "tablishment between hosts P and Q. Let X and Y be two random 32-bit starting"}, {"y0": 0.5712209304516095, "y1": 0.5857558136617628, "x0": 0.23496241281453822, "x1": 0.8364661736516269, "t": "sequence numbers chosen by P and Q respectively. Suppose P sends a TCP connec-"}, {"y0": 0.5884848482133603, "y1": 0.6018181815466936, "x0": 0.23496239527067916, "x1": 0.8364661561077678, "t": "tion request message to Q with a TCP segment having SYN bit = 1, SEQ number"}, {"y0": 0.6030303031701849, "y1": 0.6177325579568208, "x0": 0.23684209702506492, "x1": 0.8383458578621534, "t": "= X, and ACK bit = 0. Suppose Q accepts the connection request. Which one of"}, {"y0": 0.6191860467088769, "y1": 0.633939394163526, "x0": 0.234962411310779, "x1": 0.8364661721478676, "t": "the following choices represents the information present in the TCP segment header"}, {"y0": 0.6351515149836569, "y1": 0.6497093019829836, "x0": 0.23308270860494962, "x1": 0.40789473850031355, "t": "that is sent by Q to P?"}, {"y0": 0.680232558307629, "y1": 0.6962209301855883, "x0": 0.18984962345668957, "x1": 0.22180451134907483, "t": "(A)"}, {"y0": 0.6816860466627644, "y1": 0.6976744185407238, "x0": 0.21992482186900128, "x1": 0.836466143243781, "t": "SYN bit = 1, SEQ number = X+1, ACK bit = 0, ACK number = Y, FIN bit = 0"}, {"y0": 0.729651162804791, "y1": 0.7456395346827503, "x0": 0.1917293313167642, "x1": 0.8345864673405935, "t": "(B) SYN bit = 0, SEQ number = X+1, ACK bit = 0, ACK number = Y, FIN bit = 1"}, {"y0": 0.7775757573102077, "y1": 0.7936046510988634, "x0": 0.18984961921240143, "x1": 0.8364661573289521, "t": "(C) | SYN bit = 1, SEQ number = Y, ACK bit = 1, ACK number = X+1, FIN bit = 0"}, {"y0": 0.8254545456815713, "y1": 0.8418181820452076, "x0": 0.18984963460086202, "x1": 0.8289473685319699, "t": "(D) | SYN bit = 1, SEQ number = Y, ACK bit = 1, ACK number = X, FIN bit = 0"}, {"y0": 0.9460606058697669, "y1": 0.9593939392031002, "x0": 0.1541353369705437, "x1": 0.3984962338314616, "t": "CS, Set-2 - Copyright \u00a9 GATE 2021"}, {"y0": 0.9460606060635655, "y1": 0.9593939393968989, "x0": 0.7537594006215455, "x1": 0.8477443572731912, "t": "Page 13 of 43"}]